<title>MALAYSIA: India's STC, Pakistan seek palm oil - traders.</title>
<headline>India's STC, Pakistan seek palm oil - traders.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's STC is tendering on Tuesday to buy 6,000 tonnes of RBD palm olein for first half October shipment, traders said.</p>
<p>Pakistan is also in the market for 6,000 tonnes RBD palm oil and 3,000 tonnes palm olein, both for first half September shipment, they said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-2308911)</p>
</text>
